# Optimized Pharmacy Invoice Import

The AyurStock Pro "Import Bill" feature has been refined to handle pharmacy invoices with precision and automated intelligence.

## Refined Import Logic

### 1. Smart Pricing
- **Purchase Rate**: Automatically saved from the invoice **PTS** (Price to Store).
- **Automated MRP**: If the MRP is missing from the invoice, the system now automatically calculates an estimated MRP with a **20% markup** (`Purchase Rate * 1.2`).

### 2. Seamless Master Data Integration
- The system now ensures that any medicine not already in your **Medicine Master** is created first.
- Once the master record is secured, it proceeds to create or update the corresponding **Inventory Batch**.
- This ensures no data is lost and prevents silent failures.

### 3. Clear Post-Import Summary
After every import, you will see a clear breakdown of the work done:
> "7 medicines imported  
> 7 inventory batches created  
> Total stock added: 245 units"

### 4. Integrity of Medicine Master
> [!IMPORTANT]
> These advanced inventory-focused changes are completely isolated from the standard **"Import Medicines"** (Medicine Master) feature, ensuring your existing catalog management remains stable.

